{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "I'll Tell You", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 7, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Future Continuous tense to talk about something happening at a particular time in the future.<br/>You use the Future Perfect tense to talk about an action in the future before another action in the future. This is the past in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous</span> tense, the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:  <br/><span class=\"italic\">I will be studying at the library at 4 p.m. tomorrow. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The person will start studying at some point in the future and be studying at 4 p.m. It is not clear when the person will stop studying. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect</span>, you can sometimes think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">You can call me at work at 8 a.m. I <span class=\"strong\">will have arrived</span> at the office by 8.  <br/>The train will leave the station at 9 a.m. You will arrive at the station at 9:15 a.m. When you arrive, the train <span class=\"strong\">will have left</span>.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the chart for the structure of the Future Continuous and Future Perfect tenses:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Structure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> (<span class=\\\"italic\\\">not</span>) + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">be</span> + verb <span class=\\\"italic\\\">-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tomorrow I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'ll be yelling</span> at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">will</span> + <span class=\\\"italic\\\">have</span> + past participle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have racked up</span> a huge bill.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I will have racked up a huge bill.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Tomorrow I'll be yelling at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I\u2018ll be working extra hours to pay off the trip, and after a while I will start putting some away. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I hope I will be enjoying financial freedom at an old age.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We'll be sitting on benches and feeding the birds before you know it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "By that point I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about a things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class=\"italic\">will</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you ask about intentions, you use <span class=\"italic\">be going to</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the Present Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you talk about schedules, you use the Simple Present. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'll invest in real estate probably.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am going to stay home and watch a lot of television.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm not spending any money for the next little while.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Our plane leaves at 7 a.m.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be in the red", "type": "name"}, {"content": " if you or \u200byour \u200bbank \u200baccount are in the red, you \u200bowe \u200bmoney to the \u200bbank", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: By the time we arrive home I'll be in the red.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about money.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to rack up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get a large number or amount of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will have racked up a huge bill.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be worth it", "type": "name"}, {"content": "used for saying that there is a good enough reason for doing something, because it is important, enjoyable or useful ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was worth it, though.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "agenda", "type": "name"}, {"content": "all the things that need to be done in a particular time period", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What's on your agenda for the next week?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "financial profile", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a description of a person, group, or organization that contains all their money details ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: By this time next week I will have changed my entire financial profile.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "back to the grind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go back to the job at hand", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Back to the grind! I\u2018ll be working extra hours to pay off the trip.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "retirement", "type": "name"}, {"content": " the time (particularly in old age) after you stop working", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm excited to have more time to myself after my retirement.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nest egg", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an amount of money that is saved over a long period of time to pay for something in the future", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: By that point I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "restraint", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a way of limiting, controlling, or stopping something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's just a matter of having some restraint.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe yourself as twenty to forty years older than you are now.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a dialogue between yourself now and your future self.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make your present self ask your future self questions about life in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I tell someone about how I imagine myself in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask questions about the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well that was a whirlwind vacation. I can't believe it's finished! By the time we arrive home, I'll be in the red. I will have racked up a huge bill and it'll be more than I can pay back in a couple of months! I am going to stay home and watch a lot of television. I'm not spending any money for the next little while.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It was worth it though.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It was worth every penny. What's on your agenda for the next week?"}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "28000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm visiting my financial advisor to chat about what to do with my investments. I'm going to try some higher risk investments. By this time next week I will have changed my entire financial profile. I will also have started a new blog.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Tomorrow, I'll be yelling at everyone in the kitchen, no doubt! Back to the grind! I'll be working extra hours to pay off the trip and, after a while I will start putting some away.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What are you doing with the money you save?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll invest in real estate probably. I've also begun a small retirement plan that I want to expand."}, {"image": "engenn9le14ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "65000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Retirement?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I hope I will be enjoying financial freedom at an old age.<br/>\nWe'll be sitting on benches and feeding the birds before you know it. By that point, I will have accumulated a large enough nest egg that I won't have to worry. I just like to be prepared. It's just a matter of having some restraint which I certainly did not have on our holiday!  We'd better go to bed now. Our plane leaves at 7 a.m.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Goodnight V!"}], "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about money, emotions, and behavior.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about future action. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I will be doing or what I will have done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you like to think about the future? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Can you imagine what your life will be like in thirty or forty years?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "My ideas about the future.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Sally talk about their financial futures!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "typ